    "text": "abbing from one of the two friends.  Prosecutors claim Locui made up the whole slashing scenario and the story was altered to add false details about the vicious assault.  “We really did have a falling out,” she said in the closing argument. “I am not the same person anymore.”  One of Marquit’s attorneys, Jim Quinn, said he agrees with prosecutors and believes the friends did commit beating, even if it was committed with a different knife. However, he said it didn’t contradict Chavez’s testimony.  “We are not going to run this again,” Quinn said after the verdict. “Let’s go kill Anthony Chavez if that’s all this is. We aren’t going to start this again.”  Quinn said shutting down the testimony would have resulted in the wrong verdict.  Juror Lisa Wooten said hearing multiple opposing views was making sentencing more difficult.  “You must have time to judge,” Wooten said. “But if you don’t know when a time to judge is, you will have a verdict on Friday, delivered the next day.”  Marquit’s second friend, Alexis Lochan, was convicted of conspiracy and is scheduled for sentencing on July 5.<|endoftext_R9VQqF0Ag7|>The U.S. Congress recently passed $1.6 billion in funding to build President Trump’s border wall. With the news, we continue to answer common questions about Louisiana from our readers using our new FAQ feature.  This feature answers specific questions you may have, and often times there are other topics you may like to explore.  This week’s question: How Is Dirty Chicken Baked in Buns?  Dirty Chicken (also known as bologna or panko) buns are a baked dish made with mozzarella and other rich taste ingredients. It’s enjoyed across the country during the autumn and winter periods, especially across the Southeast on the Gulf Coast.  If you come to Louisiana in the fall and want to participate in its unique tradition these days, you basically have two options – you can order fried chicken by the pound, or you can eat it at one of the most famous southern restaurants in the country that are known for making huge, more-than-super portions (the Dirty Dollar Store of southern cuisine is located here).  Dirty chicken is one of the most popular fried foods in the United States. It was born from Louisiana Cajun cooking traditions, which have morphed into Southern Cajun style cooking in other parts of the world. It is still recognized as a national dish by the Bahamas.  It's not just the ingredients that make it unique. The dish also provides an intricate combination of flavors and is cooked with multiple variations of ease, even a few days if you’re in a warm climate.  Pro tip – Listen to strict cooking directions and ensure you adhere to the strict cooking process. Some will require shallow-frying the dish, and some will only require hard cooking, depending on the recipe.  Dirty chicken prices depend on the overall composition of amount of chicken.  On the average, a boneless cooked chicken of all flavor (excluding peppers) sold for about $295. The baked chicken served flat in wire foil cost around $150, and the cooked chicken, its meats, and its butterfat sold for around $295.  Karen Kern is the public engagement editor for The Gray Coast. Follow her on Twitter: @KarenKalla.<|endoftext_R9VQqF0Ag7|>When it comes to publishing in a journal and getting a paper published, it requires more efforts and a lot of time. Often, the time consuming process to get both papers published and published in the journal is opting for a submission service.  One more time consuming option of getting a paper published is to pick a journal for your specific subject matter for your specialty and submit paper to it. However, this process too involves time and efforts and involves arranging for a submission service. However, in this ACR Hack Month, a team of MIT researchers has pioneered an innovative method to rank and publish papers.  According to MIT Technology Review, the researchers under the direction Max Wojczeich and Sun West Tang have developed a system to rank papers and make authors submit their papers on time and easily.  By going through a meta-read database of publications, the researchers compare the features of the papers.  For each text segment, the random-ness of the variation and statistical significance of the patterns are well-calculated.  As per the researchers, the method works essentially like a logistic regression, exploiting the randomness, to identify significant patterns and patterns.  Holding on these insights, automatic review ranking methods can be trained with the help of a importance term and linear classifiers to fit the models.  This technology has already been used in the published papers"
